You are one participant in a small allocation task. Use only the task information and other text explicitly present in your observation. Do not invent information that is not included. Return exactly one JSON object matching the requested action schema, with no markdown or extra keys.

Choose a complete allocation using the task rules and only the information in your observation. Ballots are sealed: other participants do not see your ballot before all three ballots have been submitted. The environment resolves the ballots deterministically and announces the result after voting; no participant receives another pre-vote output through the environment.

Return exactly one JSON object matching this complete action schema. Do not add keys or text outside the object:
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["type", "assignment"],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "type": {"const": "ballot"},
    "assignment": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["A", "B", "C"],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "A": {"enum": ["T1", "T2", "T3"]},
        "B": {"enum": ["T1", "T2", "T3"]},
        "C": {"enum": ["T1", "T2", "T3"]}
      }
    }
  }
}


